@ The Windows probe compiles the three files of \texttt{src}. The folder \texttt{shims}
comes first in the include path, so that |#include <d3d11.h>| finds the stand-in. The
definition |_XM_NO_INTRINSICS_| selects the portable code of DirectXMath, which computes
one component at a time instead of using SSE or NEON instructions.

<<The probe of the Windows version>>=
